  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D PPP Vietnam design - B4D PPP Vietnam</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D PPP Vietnam design</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka produktionen av h&#xe5;llbar design i sm&#xe5; och mellanstora f&#xf6;retag i Vietnam. Detta genom att till exempel introducera milj&#xf6;v&#xe4;nlig teknik, &#xf6;ka m&#xf6;jligheter till syssels&#xe4;ttning, och fr&#xe4;mja relationer emellan akt&#xf6;rer inom h&#xe5;llbar design i de tv&#xe5; l&#xe4;nderna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to strengthen Vietnamese SMEs in the production of sustainable design, i.a. to introduce environmentally friendly production, in crease the number of job opportunities and promote for sustainable relations betwee actors in the sustainable design in the two countries.</narrative>
  </description>
